    "description": "The Favorite Pets Retrieval API allows users to access a list of pets marked as favorites in the pet adoption platform. This endpoint serves the needs of pet adopters who want to view their favorite pets for potential adoption. By retrieving this information, users can easily manage their preferred choices and streamline their decision-making process. The API is particularly useful for individuals and organizations involved in pet adoption and fostering, enhancing user experience by providing quick access to favorite pets.",
